---
import { siteConfig } from '@/config/site';
import { portfolio } from '@/data/portfolio';
---

<section class="console-output identity-output" data-output-key="identity">
	<div class="ascii-art-container" aria-hidden="true">
		<pre class="ascii-art ascii-word">
██╗  ██╗███████╗██╗      █████╗ ███╗   ███╗ █████╗ ███╗   ██╗
██║  ██║██╔════╝██║     ██╔══██╗████╗ ████║██╔══██╗████╗  ██║
███████║█████╗  ██║     ███████║██╔████╔██║███████║██╔██╗ ██║
██╔══██║██╔══╝  ██║     ██╔══██║██║╚██╔╝██║██╔══██║██║╚██╗██║
██║  ██║███████╗███████╗██║  ██║██║ ╚═╝ ██║██║  ██║██║ ╚████║
╚═╝  ╚═╝╚══════╝╚══════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝     ╚═╝╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝  ╚═══╝</pre>
		<pre class="ascii-art ascii-word">
██████╗  █████╗ ██████╗  ██████╗██╗ █████╗ 
██╔════╝ ██╔══██╗██╔══██╗██╔════╝██║██╔══██╗
██║  ███╗███████║██████╔╝██║     ██║███████║
██║   ██║██╔══██║██╔══██╗██║     ██║██╔══██║
╚██████╔╝██║  ██║██║  ██║╚██████╗██║██║  ██║
 ╚═════╝ ╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝  ╚═╝ ╚═════╝╚═╝╚═╝  ╚═╝</pre>
	</div>
	<div class="identity-grid">
		<p><span class="output-key">name</span> {portfolio.name}</p>
		<p><span class="output-key">exp</span> {portfolio.experienceSummary}</p>
		<p><span class="output-key">location</span> {siteConfig.location}</p>
	</div>
	<div class="identity-bio">
		<span class="output-key">bio</span>
		<div class="bio-paragraphs">
			{portfolio.about.map((paragraph) => <p>{paragraph}</p>)}
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="identity-target">
		<span class="output-key">target</span>
		<div class="target-list">
			<p class="target-intro">Busco incorporarme a equipos y proyectos en las siguientes áreas:</p>
			{
				portfolio.interests.map((item) => (
					<p>
						<span class="target-name">{item.name}</span>
						<span class="target-detail">{item.detail}</span>
					</p>
				))
			}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
